      "bytes": 689274,
      "seconds": 7.814,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_eventstory_8_01_073.wav",
      "subtitle": "我也不是反对演出和练习。\n毕竟我觉得要想在活动里取胜，也需要相应的练习和演出经验"
    },
    {
      "slug": "miku",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "miku",
      "characterId": 22,
      "text": "要练习，对吧？",
